Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 03:33:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 48/60] Sync the liveness engine: F15 NaN similarity and
 identity threshold floor (task 19 review)

Engine jars from Mosip26 9a72eb6 (f15-identity-binding: "F15 engine: a NaN
similarity blocks, and the identity threshold has a floor of 0.30"):
- FaceMatcher.identify: a readable template whose similarity is not a
  finite number is NO_MATCH, no longer NOT_BOUND_UNREADABLE (which the
  gate accepted on presence);
- AnalyzerConfig: the identity threshold must be in [0.30, 1.0]. On
  Android an out-of-range value makes analyzerConfig fall back to the
  Android defaults (0.40), as for any invalid analyzer key.
The models and CameraXFrameSource.java are unchanged (same SHA-256).

:liveness:testDebugUnitTest: 113 tests, all passing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
